WEBVTT

00:11:29.307 --> 00:11:30.641
Like what?

00:11:30.665 --> 00:11:32.808
Well, there's no
silver bullet, as they say,

00:11:32.832 --> 00:11:35.276
but there's plenty of silver buckshot.

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:37.069
(Laughter)

00:11:38.593 --> 00:11:40.696
There's simple solutions
that save us money

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:43.077
and reduce our carbon footprint
at the same time.

00:11:43.736 --> 00:11:45.148
Yes, light bulbs.

00:11:45.911 --> 00:11:47.377
I love my plug-in car.

00:11:47.841 --> 00:11:49.774
I'd like some solar shingles.

00:11:50.159 --> 00:11:55.123
But imagine if every home
came with a switch beside the front door,

00:11:55.147 --> 00:11:58.886
that when you left the house, you could
turn off everything except your fridge.

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:00.135
And maybe the DVR.